:: Revelation Journal Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'lost-lamb-journal'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      It is <<= getFormattedDate(Time.date)>>, <<ampm Time.hour Time.minute>>. <i>You cannot place the year. These dates belong to the dream.</i>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      梦中是 <<= getFormattedDate(Time.date)>>，<<ampm Time.hour Time.minute>>。<i>你无法确定年份，这些日期属于梦境。</i>
  <</language>>
  <<revelation-card 'The manor' '庄园'>>
    <ul class='journal'>
    <li>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You are Kylar here. Day <span class='gold'><<= maplebirch.get('LostLamb').day>></span> in the dream.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在这里，你是凯拉尔。梦中的第 <span class='gold'><<= maplebirch.get('LostLamb').day>></span> 天。
    <</language>>
    </li>
    <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').note>>
      <li><<print lanSwitch(...maplebirch.get('LostLamb').note)>></li>
    <</if>>
    <<if !$settings.blindStatsEnabled>>
      <li>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Doubt:
        <<option 'CN'>>
          疑心：
      <</language>>
      <span class='lblue'><<= $LostLamb.doubt>>/100</span></li>
      <li>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Unease:
        <<option 'CN'>>
          不安：
      <</language>>
      <span class='red'><<= $LostLamb.fear>>/100</span></li>
      <li>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Attention drawn:
        <<option 'CN'>>
          引起的注意：
      <</language>>
      <span class='gold'><<= $LostLamb.notice>>/100</span></li>
    <</if>>
    <li><i>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Doubt helps you notice discrepancies. Unease can make listening or keeping still harder. The attention you draw changes who comes looking. These feelings do not tell you which account is true.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        疑心让你留意矛盾。不安可能让倾听或保持不动更难。引起的注意会改变谁来找你。这些感受不能替你判断哪种讲述是真相。
    <</language>>
    </i></li>
    <li class='teal'>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You may wake at any time. Rest at the manor to return to where you stopped.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        随时可以醒来，再到庄园休息便能从中断处继续。
    <</language>>
    </li>
    </ul>
  <</revelation-card>>
  <hr>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'lost-lamb-record'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb') and !$statFreeze
      and (maplebirch.get('LostLamb').paused
      or !(maplebirch.get('LostLamb').mainReady and $LostLamb.endings.includes('main'))
      and ($LostLamb.scene or $LostLamb.endings.length))>>
    <<revelation-card 'Kylar\'s manor' '凯拉尔的庄园'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
      <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb')?.paused>>
        <li class='teal'>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The dream was interrupted. Rest in Kylar's room to continue.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            梦境中断了。到凯拉尔房间休息，可以继续。
        <</language>>
        </li>
      <</if>>
      <<if !(maplebirch.get('LostLamb').mainReady and $LostLamb.endings.includes('main'))>>
        <<if $LostLamb.endings.includes('main')>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You dreamed of the visits, the night of breaking glass, and the mornings after. Not everything you saw was something Kylar could have witnessed.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你梦见旧日的来访、玻璃碎裂的夜晚，以及随后的早晨。你看见的，并不全是凯拉尔可能亲眼见证的事。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <<elseif $LostLamb.endings.length>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You woke before you could leave the past behind. You can return to the dream.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你还没能离开过去，就醒了。仍可以再次进入梦境。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
        <<if $LostLamb.endings.includes('stay')>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('stay-vow-bound')>>
                You gave Sydney's name to the lock. The figure stayed, and neither of you could leave.
              <<else>>
                You left the afternoon with torn paper. The knocks followed you.
              <</if>>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('stay-vow-bound')>>
                你把悉尼的名字交给锁。那身影留下了，你们谁也不能出门。
              <<else>>
                你握着撕破的纸离开下午。敲击声跟了过来。
              <</if>>
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
        <<if $LostLamb.endings.includes('verdict')>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-sealed')>>
                You promised to keep the visitor's words inside. Asking for help would break that promise.
              <<elseif $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-broken')>>
                You broke your promise to the visitor and called for help outside.
              <<else>>
                You refused to keep the visitor's secret. The child was still calling upstairs.
              <</if>>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-sealed')>>
                你答应把来客的话藏在屋里。开口求助，就会违背约定。
              <<elseif $LostLamb.marks.includes('verdict-vow-broken')>>
                你违背了与来客的约定，向屋外的人求助。
              <<else>>
                你没有替来客保密。孩子仍在楼上喊人。
              <</if>>
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
        <<if $LostLamb.endings.includes('main')>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-offered')>>
                You gave the voice your name. Nobody left the house. Nobody answered you.
              <<elseif $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-refused')>>
                You refused to give your name and called to the window. The knocking did not stop.
              <<else>>
                You woke before the voice at the door finished asking.
              <</if>>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <<if $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-offered')>>
                你把自己的名字交给声音。屋里谁也没离开，谁也不再答应你。
              <<elseif $LostLamb.marks.includes('main-vow-refused')>>
                你没有交出名字，朝窗户喊了人。敲击声没有停下。
              <<else>>
                门边的声音还没问完，你就醒了。
              <</if>>
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('LostLamb').mainReady and !$LostLamb.endings.includes('main')>>
          <li class='teal'>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You remember another voice beneath both dreams. Return to the manor to listen for it.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你记得两种梦境下都藏着另一个声音。回到庄园，可以再听一听。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 罗宾与神殿 -->
<<widget 'robin-temple-examination-days'>>
  <<set _templeExamDays to Math.max(0,
    maplebirch.get('RobinTemple') and ($RobinTemple.dual_promise or maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is 'Robin')
      ? ($RobinTemple.monthly_checked ? Math.min($temple_chastity_timer, $RobinTemple.chastity_timer) : 0)
      : $temple_chastity_timer)>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'robin-temple-journal'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple?.stage and $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'none'>>
    <<revelation-card 'Robin and the temple' '罗宾与神殿'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin’s current rank: ' '罗宾当前职位：'>><span class='teal'><<temple_title 'Robin'>></span>。</li>
      <</if>>
      <<switch $RobinTemple.stage>>
        <<case 'invited'>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin has questions about joining the temple. Find <<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>
              <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').residence>>
                at your shared home
              <<else>>
                in <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> room
              <</if>>
              when <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> is free, and visit Jordan together during the day, outside the Sunday service.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾对加入神殿还有疑问。等<<nnpc_he 'Robin'>>有空时，去
              <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').residence>>
                你们同住的自宅
              <<else>>
                罗宾房间
              <</if>>
              谈谈，再一起于白天、周日弥撒以外的时段拜访约旦。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <<case 'scheduled'>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin's purity trial is booked for <span class='gold'><<= getFormattedDate(new DateTime(Time.date).addDays($RobinTemple.exam_day - Time.days))>></span>. If that date has passed, the appointment remains booked.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾的纯洁试炼预约在 <span class='gold'><<= getFormattedDate(new DateTime(Time.date).addDays($RobinTemple.exam_day - Time.days))>></span>。日期已过时，预约仍会保留。
          <</language>>
          </li>
          <<if Time.days lt $RobinTemple.exam_day and $RobinTemple.prepared_day isnot Time.days>>
            <li>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Before the trial, find Robin at home from 17:00 to 19:15 and prepare together. Allow forty-five minutes before the next school, tutoring, shop or other commitment.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                试炼日前，17:00 至 19:15 可在家中找有空的罗宾一起准备。下次上学、家教、看店或其他安排前须留足四十五分钟。
            <</language>>
            </li>
          <</if>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              If Robin cannot attend or Jordan is unavailable, the appointment will wait. Attend from 06:00 to before 08:00 on school days, or before 18:00 on days without school, outside the Sunday service.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾无法参加或约旦暂时不能接待时，预约会继续保留。上学日于 06:00 至 08:00 前参加，不上学的日子则可延至 18:00 前，周日弥撒期间需等候。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <<case 'failed'>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin needs time to decide freely. Ask again at home from <span class='gold'><<= getFormattedDate(new DateTime(Time.date).addDays($RobinTemple.exam_day + 7 - Time.days))>></span>.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾需要时间自己考虑。<span class='gold'><<= getFormattedDate(new DateTime(Time.date).addDays($RobinTemple.exam_day + 7 - Time.days))>></span> 起，可以在家中再询问。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <<case 'member'>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              On school-free weekdays, you can invite Robin from home to help at the temple from 09:00 until just before 15:45. You can also go together from 17:00 until just before 19:45, when other commitments leave fifteen minutes for the journey. Robin helps with the Sunday service.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              不上学的工作日，09:00 起至 15:45 前，可以在家中约罗宾去神殿帮忙。17:00 起至 19:45 前，其他安排为路程留足十五分钟时也可以同行。罗宾会协助周日弥撒。
          <</language>>
          </li>
          <<if !$RobinTemple.punish and $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.service gte 3 and !$templePromised>>
            <li>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Ask Robin about making a promise when <<nnpc_he 'Robin'>> is present at the temple during daylight. Jordan will weigh both your contributions, your shared work and Robin’s faith.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                罗宾白天在神殿时，可以谈承诺仪式。约旦会分别考虑你们的神殿贡献、共同完成的工作，以及罗宾对誓言的信仰。
            <</language>>
            </li>
          <</if>>
        <<case 'approved'>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Meet Robin in the temple quarters to hold the approved promise rite.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              去神殿宿舍见罗宾，举行已获批准的承诺仪式。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <<case 'promised'>>
          <<robin-temple-examination-days>>
          <<if $RobinTemple.dual_promise>>
            <li>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Jordan will summon you, Robin and Sydney together for the next examination.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                下次检查时，约旦会将你、罗宾与悉尼一并召去。
            <</language>>
            </li>
          <<else>>
            <li>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Jordan will examine the vow you share with Robin.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                约旦会一同检查你和罗宾的誓言。
            <</language>>
            </li>
          <</if>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Days until the next examination: <span class='gold'><<= _templeExamDays>></span>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              距离下次检查还有：<span class='gold'><<= _templeExamDays>></span>
          <</language>>
          </li>
          <<if _templeExamDays is 0>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Go to the temple hall for the examination. If Robin cannot attend, the examination will wait.' '到神殿大厅处理月度检查。罗宾暂时无法到场时，检查会等候。'>></li>
          <</if>>
      <</switch>>
      <<if !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').available>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin cannot take part in normal activities at present. Temple duties and invitations will wait.' '罗宾暂时无法正常活动。神殿事务与同行邀请需等候。'>></li>
      <<elseif getRobinLocation() is 'deadwood_outing'>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin is on an outing or travelling with a ride. Finish that journey before arranging temple duties.' '罗宾正在外出或接送途中。先完成当前行程，再安排神殿事务。'>></li>
      <<elseif maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').home>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin is at your shared home. Talk there when both of you are free.' '罗宾目前在你们同住的自宅。有空时可以在那里交谈。'>></li>
      <<elseif getRobinLocation() is 'tutor'>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin is teaching a lesson. Temple invitations will wait until it ends.' '罗宾正在授课，神殿邀请需等家教结束。'>></li>
      <<elseif getRobinLocation() is 'shop'>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin is working at the shop. Temple invitations will wait until it closes.' '罗宾正在看店，神殿邀请需等店铺关门。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
        <<if $RobinTemple.punish>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'The purification is unfinished. Continue it at the temple.' '净化尚未结束，返回神殿继续。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').bunk and !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').residence>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin normally stays overnight at the temple from Saturday 21:00 to Sunday 07:00, unless another arrangement takes priority.' '通常周六 21:00 至周日 07:00，罗宾会留宿神殿。另有优先安排时需等候。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Shared temple shifts: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span>. Robin's contribution: <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            已一起完成的神殿值班：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span> 次。罗宾的神殿贡献：<span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100。
        <</language>>
        </li>
        <<if !$settings.blindStatsEnabled>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Robin's faith: <span class='gold'><<= C.npc.Robin.conviction>></span>/100. Doubt: <span class='lblue'><<= C.npc.Robin.doubt>></span>/100.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              罗宾的信仰：<span class='gold'><<= C.npc.Robin.conviction>></span>/100。动摇：<span class='lblue'><<= C.npc.Robin.doubt>></span>/100。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
        <li>
        <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').bunk>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Robin has a bunk in the temple quarters.' '罗宾拥有神殿宿舍的床铺。'>>
        <<else>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Robin has not been assigned a bunk. The trial of anguish is still ahead.' '罗宾尚未分到床铺，还需要参加苦难审判。'>>
        <</if>>
        </li>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member and $RobinTemple.faith_transition>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin has something to say about the temple. Listen next time you pray together.' '罗宾有些关于神殿的想法想告诉你。下次一起祈祷时可以听听。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if ['waiting', 'discharged', 'therapy', 'rescue', 'vanilla'].includes($RobinTemple.hospital_stage)>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Your hospital visit with Robin is unfinished. You can continue it at the hospital entrance.' '罗宾陪同的这次就诊尚未结束。可以在医院门口继续。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Robin')>>
          <li>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Temple duties add <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> to Robin's weekly income. This is included in <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> business
              <<if !maplebirch.get('Finance')?.orphanage.robinFree and !$RobinExpansion?.bailey_defeated>>
                and rent
              <</if>>
              accounts.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              神殿事务为罗宾带来每周 <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> 的津贴，计入<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>经营收入
              <<if !maplebirch.get('Finance')?.orphanage.robinFree and !$RobinExpansion?.bailey_defeated>>
                与房租结算
              <</if>>
              。
          <</language>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Robin') and $RobinExpansion?.tutor>>
        <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin's tutoring days: <<= maplebirch.get('Robin').tutoring.lessonDays.map(day => ['Sunday', 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday', 'Saturday'][day - 1]).join(', ')>>. Lessons run from 17:30 to 18:30 on school days.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾当前家教日：<<= maplebirch.get('Robin').tutoring.lessonDays.map(day => ['周日', '周一', '周二', '周三', '周四', '周五', '周六'][day - 1]).join('、')>>。上学日 17:30 至 18:30 授课。
        <</language>>
        </li>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Robin') and $RobinExpansion?.shop>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin works at the shop from 18:30 to 21:00, including when staff have been hired.' '罗宾每天 18:30 至 21:00 亲自看店，雇员在场时也如此。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member and $temple_spear_mission is 1 and !$spear_vessel and !$RobinTemple.spear_seen and $robinromance is 1>>
        <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin has heard about Jordan’s spear mission. Speak to Robin at the temple bench before setting out.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾听说了约旦交代的取矛任务。出发前，可以在神殿长椅与罗宾谈谈。
        <</language>>
        </li>
      <<elseif maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member and $temple_spear_mission gte 2 and $RobinTemple.spear_seen and !$RobinTemple.spear_return_seen>>
        <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You promised to tell Robin how the spear journey went. Find <<nnpc_him 'Robin'>> at the temple bench.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你答应把取矛的经过告诉罗宾。去神殿长椅找<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>。
        <</language>>
        </li>
      <</if>>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 混乱誓约 -->
<<widget 'secret-promise-next-step'>>
  <<set $_secret to maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret>>
  <<if !$_secret.eligible>>
    <<if !$_secret.known>>
      <<lanSwitch 'You still need the bishop’s account, the gaoler and witch’s ending, and the vision beneath the lake before pursuing this plan.' '你还需亲历主教的揭密、狱卒与女巫的结局，以及湖底幻境，才能追查这个计划。'>>
    <<elseif !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member or !$temple_rank or $temple_rank is 'prospective'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Both you and Robin must formally join the temple before pursuing this promise.' '你与罗宾都需正式加入神殿，再追查这份承诺。'>>
    <<elseif !$_secret.unfitted>>
      <<lanSwitch 'You, Robin and Sydney must first remove all chastity fittings. Discuss Robin’s temple fittings at the temple quarters; asking for removal does not remove them.' '你、罗宾和悉尼都需要先取下贞操器具。罗宾的神殿器具可以到宿舍商量拆除，仅提出申请不算取下。'>>
    <<elseif !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').available>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Robin cannot go with you at present. Wait until Robin can take part in ordinary activities again.' '罗宾暂时无法同行。等罗宾能够正常活动后，再商量出行。'>>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.punish or $player.virginity.temple isnot true
        or C.npc.Robin.virginity.temple isnot true or C.npc.Sydney.virginity.temple isnot true>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Resolve the outstanding purification or broken temple vows before continuing.' '先处理尚未结束的净化或破损的神殿誓言，再继续调查。'>>
    <<elseif $robinromance isnot 1 or $sydneyromance isnot 1 or C.npc.Robin.love lt 80 or C.npc.Sydney.love lt 125>>
      <<lanSwitch 'This plan needs a close romantic relationship with both companions: Robin’s love must be at least 80, and Sydney’s at least 125.' '这个计划需要你与两人保持亲密的恋爱关系：罗宾爱意至少 80，悉尼爱意至少 125。'>>
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 40>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Robin’s distress has eased, and Robin no longer wants to pursue this investigation. The plan is on hold.' '罗宾的创伤已经缓和，不再愿意追查这件事。计划暂时搁下。'>>
    <<elseif C.npc.Sydney.purity gte 50 or C.npc.Sydney.corruption lt 10>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Sydney’s current beliefs do not allow this rite. You cannot continue with Sydney in this state.' '悉尼目前的信仰立场不允许这场仪式，无法按原计划继续。'>>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and !$sydneySeen?.includes('corruptroom')>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Sydney has not yet completed the corrupt promise rite. Speak with Sydney about that before seeking a second promise.' '悉尼尚未完成堕落仪式。先与悉尼处理这件事，再寻求第二份承诺。'>>
    <<elseif !hasSexStat('promiscuity', 6)>>
      <<lanSwitch 'You are not yet prepared to seek both promises.' '你还没有准备好同时寻求两份承诺。'>><<promiscuous 6>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'This plan requires one existing promise, with Robin or Sydney. If that promise changes during the investigation, you cannot continue with the old plan.' '这个计划需要你已与罗宾或悉尼中的一人承诺。调查期间，已有承诺发生变化，就无法继续原来的计划。'>>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.stage is 'none'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Speak to Robin privately at home to begin the investigation.' '在家中找有空的罗宾，私下谈起调查。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day gte 0 and !$_secret.settled>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Give both companions three days after returning from the shared investigation before asking them to reconsider.' '共同调查回来后，先给两人三天考虑，再分别询问。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.robin_day lt 0
      or $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day gte 0 and $RobinTemple.secret.robin_day lt $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day + 3>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Speak to Robin privately at home when Robin is free. This conversation has not been settled yet.' '仍需和罗宾私下谈妥。在家中找有空的罗宾。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.sydney_day lt 0
      or $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day gte 0 and $RobinTemple.secret.sydney_day lt $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day + 3>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Speak to Sydney privately at the school library, temple or adult shop when Sydney is free.' '仍需和悉尼私下谈妥。在学校图书馆、神殿或成人用品商店找有空的悉尼。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.survey_day lt 0>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Survey the lake ruin in daylight, while the lake is unfrozen and no pursuit is underway.' '湖面未结冰、没有追猎时，白天到湖畔勘查废墟路线。'>>
  <<elseif !$RobinTemple.secret.prepared>>
    <<lanSwitch 'At the lake, review the route and your findings, then confirm the departure preparations.' '到湖畔核对路线与调查所得，再确认出发准备。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day lt 0
      and Time.days lt Math.max($RobinTemple.secret.robin_day, $RobinTemple.secret.sydney_day, $RobinTemple.secret.survey_day) + 3>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Leave three days after the most recent conversation or survey before setting out together.' '最后一次谈话或勘查后，需留出三天，再一同出发。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day gte 0 and (!$_secret.wants.Robin or !$_secret.wants.Sydney)>>
    <<lanSwitch 'One or both companions do not currently want the rite. Do not set out until both freely agree.' '目前仍有人不愿参与仪式。等两人都明确愿意，再商量出发。'>>
  <<elseif $stress gte $stressmax - 40 or $pain gte 50 or $tiredness gte 1500>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Rest before setting out. You are too tense, hurt or tired for the journey.' '先休息，缓和压力、疼痛或疲劳，再安排这次同行。'>>
  <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.night is Time.days>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You have already set out together tonight. Choose another blood moon night.' '今晚已经一同出发过了，另选一个血月夜吧。'>>
  <<elseif $_secret.threatened>>
    <<lanSwitch 'A pursuit or the wraith’s hostility makes the lake unsafe. Settle that danger before arranging a meeting.' '追猎或怨灵的敌意仍使湖边不安全。先处理眼前的危险，再安排会合。'>>
  <<elseif Weather.isFrozen('lake') or Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Wait for a rainless night with an unfrozen lake.' '等湖面未结冰、没有下雨的夜晚再来。'>>
  <<elseif $laketeenspresent>>
    <<lanSwitch 'People are still at the lake. Wait until the shore is empty.' '湖边还有人，等岸边无人时再来。'>>
  <<elseif !Time.isBloodMoon() or Time.hour lt 21 or Time.hour gte 23>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Your preparations are complete. Meet at the lake on a blood moon night between 21:00 and 23:00.' '准备已经齐全。血月夜 21:00 至 23:00 前，到湖畔会合。'>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The preparations and conditions are right. You can meet Robin and Sydney at the lake now.' '准备与时机都已合适，现在可以到湖畔与罗宾、悉尼会合。'>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'secret-promise-journal'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple.dual_promise and $RobinTemple.secret.stage is 'complete'
      and ['none', 'meal', 'records'].includes($RobinTemple.secret.followup)>>
    <<revelation-card 'After the night at the lake' '湖边那晚之后'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
        <<if $RobinTemple.secret.followup is 'none'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin has asked you and Sydney to share a meal and talk about the night at the lake.' '罗宾约你和悉尼一起吃饭，谈谈湖边那晚发生的事。'>></li>
        <<elseif $RobinTemple.secret.followup is 'meal'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'The meal is over. Compare your accounts with both companions.' '一起吃过饭了。和两人核对各自的记录。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'You have compared your accounts and agreed to check with one another if a voice calls. When all three of you are free, you can investigate the sound together.' '你们已核对那晚的记录，也约好听见呼唤时先向彼此确认。三个人有空时，可以继续查看那道声音。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Meet in the temple hall after 13:00, with time before 17:00 and your companions’ next commitments.' '13:00 后到神殿大厅会合，在 17:00 与同伴下一项事务前留足时间。'>></li>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
  <<if !$RobinTemple.dual_promise and !$RobinTemple.secret.rite_done
      and $RobinTemple.secret.stage isnot 'complete'
      and (maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.known or $RobinTemple.secret.stage isnot 'none')>>
    <<revelation-card 'Confounded Vow' '混乱誓约'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
      <<switch $RobinTemple.secret.stage>>
        <<case 'none' 'research'>>
          <<if $RobinTemple.secret.stage is 'research'>>
            <li>
              <<if $RobinTemple.secret.witness_day lt 0>>
                <<lanSwitch 'The first journey is only to investigate the stone. After returning, each companion will decide whether to attempt the rite.' '第一次同行只调查石头。回来后，再由两人分别决定是否参与仪式。'>>
              <<else>>
                <<lanSwitch 'After examining the stone together, you are considering the rite. Each of you remains free to change your mind.' '你们已经一起查看过石头，接下来要商议是否举行仪式。每个人都可以改变主意。'>>
              <</if>>
            </li>
          <</if>>
          <li><<secret-promise-next-step>></li>
        <<case 'decision'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'You have examined the stone. Decide whether to attempt the rite tonight. Robin and Sydney must each give their own consent.' '你们已经查看过石头。现在要决定今晚是否举行仪式，罗宾和悉尼都需要各自明确同意。'>></li>
        <<case 'travelling'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'You have met Robin and Sydney at the lake. Visit the stone together or call off the journey.' '你和罗宾、悉尼已经在湖边会合。可以一起查看废墟里的石头，也可以结束这次同行。'>></li>
        <<case 'ritual'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'The rite is underway. Each of you must give your own answer; no one can decide for the other two.' '仪式正在进行。你们需要各自表明意愿，不能由一个人替另外两人作主。'>></li>
      <</switch>>
      <<if ['travelling', 'decision', 'ritual'].includes($RobinTemple.secret.stage)
          and !maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').secret.active>>
        <li class='red'><<lanSwitch 'This journey has been interrupted. Return to the lake shore to call it off before making another plan.' '这次同行已经中断。回到湖畔取消这次同行，再安排新的计划。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 神殿唱诗班 -->
<<widget 'temple-choir-journal'>>
  <<if $TempleChoir.joined>>
    <<revelation-card 'Temple choir' '神殿唱诗班'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Practice: 09:00–18:00, once a day, except during Sunday mass (0:30). Service: Sunday, 11:00–13:00 (1:00).' '练习：每天 09:00–18:00 一次，周日弥撒期间暂停（0:30）。唱诗：周日 11:00–13:00（1:00）。'>></li>
      <li>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Completed practices: <span class='teal'><<= $TempleChoir.practices>></span>. Completed services: <span class='teal'><<= $TempleChoir.services>></span>.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          已完成练习：<span class='teal'><<= $TempleChoir.practices>></span> 次。已完整参加唱诗：<span class='teal'><<= $TempleChoir.services>></span> 次。
      <</language>>
      </li>
      <<if $TempleChoir.bonus gt 0>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Uncollected choir earnings: ' '尚未领取的唱诗加款：'>><span class='gold'><<printmoney $TempleChoir.bonus>></span><<lanSwitch '. Collect them after passing a monthly examination when the temple allowance is paid.' '。月度检查通过且神殿津贴获发时领取。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <li>
      <<if $TempleChoir.lead>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Jordan has allowed you to lead the responses.' '约旦已允许你领唱答唱。'>>
      <<else>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Regular practice, completed services and good singing help you qualify to lead the responses.' '坚持练习、完整参加唱诗并提高歌唱表现，可以争取领唱答唱的资格。'>>
      <</if>>
      </li>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 神殿职务、旧资料室与当前委托 -->
<<widget 'temple-duties-journal'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('TempleDuties') and $TempleDuties.enrolled>>
    <<temple-duty-check>>
    <<revelation-card 'Temple duties' '神殿职务'>>
      <ul class='journal'>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Duties desk: 09:00–18:00, outside Sunday mass. One paid shift daily; leave enough time to finish.' '职务桌：09:00–18:00，周日弥撒期间暂停。每天可完成一班有薪职务，接班前须留足时间。'>></li>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Completed shifts: ' '已完成值班：'>><span class='teal'><<print $TempleDuties.duties>></span>。
      <<if $TempleDuties.duty_day is Math.floor(Time.days)>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Today’s shift is complete.' '今日已完成值班。'>>
      <</if>>
      </li>
      <<if $temple_rank is 'priest'>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'You may supervise a shift and arrange inspections of resolved cases after seven days. Each case pays once.' '可以指导值班，并在七天后回访已解决的案件。同一案件只支付一次报酬。'>></li>
      <</if>>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Archive reading time: ' '档案查阅时间：'>><span class='teal'><<print _studyMinutes>></span><<lanSwitch ' minutes. Restored folios: ' '分钟。散页修复：'>><span class='teal'><<print $TempleDuties.archive.sorted>> / 3</span>。</li>
      <<for _journalRepair range ['roof', 'shelves']>>
        <<if $TempleDuties.archive[_journalRepair] gte 0>>
          <li>
          <<lanSwitch `_journalRepair is 'roof' ? 'Roof and drainage: ' : 'Shelves: '` `_journalRepair is 'roof' ? '屋顶与排水：' : '书架：'`>>
          <<if Time.days gte $TempleDuties.archive[_journalRepair]>>
            <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'completed.' '已竣工。'>></span>
          <<else>>
            <span class='teal'><<lanSwitch 'completion ' '竣工日期：'>>
            <<print getFormattedDate(new DateTime(Time.date).addDays($TempleDuties.archive[_journalRepair] - Math.floor(Time.days)))>></span>
          <</if>>
          </li>
        <</if>>
      <</for>>
      </ul>
    <</revelation-card>>
    <hr>
    <<if $TempleDuties.case>>
      <<set _caseHeading to $TempleDuties.case.id is 'echo' ? ['Knocking after lights-out', '熄灯后的敲击'] : $TempleDuties.case.id is 'roots' ? ['Roots beneath the records', '卷宗下的根须'] : ['The returned donation crate', '退回的捐赠箱']>>
      <<revelation-card _caseHeading[0] _caseHeading[1]>>
        <ul class='journal'>
        <<if $TempleDuties.case.stage is 'report'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Return to Jordan’s duties desk during the day to give your report.' '白天回约旦的职务桌，汇报调查结果。'>></li>
        <<elseif $TempleDuties.case.stage is 'combat'>>
          <li class='red'><<lanSwitch 'An encounter is underway. Finish it or leave safely before filing a report.' '遭遇正在进行。结束或安全撤离后，才能提交报告。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch `$TempleDuties.case.id is 'crate' ? 'Inspect the returned crate at the docks.' : 'Inspect the assigned storeroom through the duties desk or old records room.'` `$TempleDuties.case.id is 'crate' ? '到码头检查退回的货箱。' : '从职务桌或旧资料室前往委托中的储藏室。'`>></li>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Jordan can lend a lamp, rope and gloves. Read the archive, keep a way out and record what you actually find.' '可向约旦借灯、绳索与手套。查阅档案，留下出口，如实记录调查所得。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        </ul>
      <</revelation-card>>
      <hr>
    <</if>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.watch and !['passed', 'failed'].includes($TempleDuties.watch.phase)>>
      <<revelation-card 'The lower-door watch' '门前守望'>>
        <ul class='journal'>
        <<if ['roots', 'shadow'].includes($TempleDuties.watch.phase) and $combat>>
          <li class='red'><<lanSwitch 'The fight is unfinished.' '战斗尚未结束。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Return through the duties desk to continue the watch.' '从职务桌返回下层，继续守望。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Time remaining: ' '剩余时限：'>><span class='gold'><<print Math.max(0, Math.ceil(($TempleDuties.watch.until - Time.date.timeStamp) / 60))>></span><<lanSwitch ' minutes.' '分钟。'>></li>
        </ul>
      <</revelation-card>>
      <hr>
    <</if>>
    <<if $temple_rank is 'monk' and $TempleDuties.ordained lt 0>>
      <<revelation-card 'Priest appointment' '司祭任命'>>
        <ul class='journal'>
        <<if _flockRescued>>
          <li class='teal'><<lanSwitch 'The missing temple member has been rescued from the Danube Street manor.' '已从多瑙河街宅邸救回失踪教徒。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Rescue the missing temple member from the manor on Danube Street.' '从多瑙河街的宅邸救回失踪的神殿成员。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <<if _spearReturned>>
          <li class='teal'><<lanSwitch 'The golden spear has been returned to Jordan.' '已将金色长矛交还约旦。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Bring the golden spear back to Jordan.' '将金色长矛交还约旦。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <<if $TempleDuties.trial_day gte 0>>
          <li class='teal'><<lanSwitch 'The lower-door watch has been completed.' '已完成下层门前的守望。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Complete the lower-door watch before the interview. Begin before 14:00 with three hours free.' '任职面谈前，先完成下层门前的守望。14:00 前开始，预留三小时。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Jordan can discuss your appointment at the duties desk before 17:00.' '17:00 前可在职务桌与约旦商谈任命。'>></li>
        </ul>
      <</revelation-card>>
      <hr>
    <</if>>
    <<for _journalCandidate range ['Robin', 'Sydney']>>
      <<set $_journalRank to _journalCandidate is 'Robin' ? maplebirch.get('RobinTemple')?.rank : $sydney?.rank>>
      <<set _journalPreparation to $TempleDuties.candidates[_journalCandidate]>>
      <<if C.npc[_journalCandidate]?.init is 1 and _journalPreparation.agreed and $_journalRank is 'monk'>>
        <<revelation-card `maplebirch.auto(_journalCandidate) + ' · Ordination'` `maplebirch.auto(_journalCandidate) + ' · 司祭任职'`>>
          <ul class='journal'>
          <<if !_journalPreparation.lessons.includes('care')>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Accompany prayers and a parish visit through the preparation book.' '通过任职准备名册，陪同参与祈祷与教区成员接待。'>></li>
          <</if>>
          <<if !_journalPreparation.lessons.includes('wards')>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Accompany a ward inspection with the older priest.' '陪同资深司祭检查护符。'>></li>
          <</if>>
          <<if _journalPreparation.trial_day lt 0>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Take the lower-door watch together. Help your companion keep the lamp steady, then join their prayers when the voice calls. They need your support at both points.' '共同参加下层门前的守望。在门口陪同伴稳住灯火，听见门后呼唤时，再陪同伴念祷文，两处都需要照应。'>></li>
          <<elseif !_journalPreparation.reviewed>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Accompany the appointment interview with Jordan.' '陪同参加约旦的任职面谈。'>></li>
          <<else>>
            <li><<lanSwitch 'Jordan has heard your companion’s answers. Return to the warm room together when you are both free.' '约旦已听过同伴的回答。两人有空时，一起到暖室接受任命。'>></li>
          <</if>>
          </ul>
        <</revelation-card>>
        <hr>
      <</if>>
    <</for>>
    <<if $TempleDuties.bishop is 'accepted'>>
      <<revelation-card 'The sealed comparison' '密封的比对记录'>>
        <ul class='journal'>
        <<if $TempleDuties.bishop_checked>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Return to the duties desk and give the sealed copy to the bishop waiting there as a confessor.' '回职务桌，把密封副本交给以告解员身份等候的主教。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Read the old crate handover records, resolve the crate investigation and report honestly to Jordan, then compare the marks in the old records room.' '查阅旧货箱交接记录，完成货箱调查并向约旦如实汇报，再到旧资料室比对标记。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        </ul>
      <</revelation-card>>
      <hr>
    <</if>>
    <<if ['accepted', 'copied'].includes($TempleDuties.manor)>>
      <<revelation-card 'The manor’s monstrance' '庄园中的圣体匣'>>
        <ul class='journal'>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'Read the indexed description in the old records room.' '到旧资料室查阅索引中的描述。'>></li>
        <<if $TempleDuties.manor is 'accepted'>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Speak to Kylar at the manor during an evening visit.' '傍晚去庄园拜访凯拉尔，询问圣体匣。'>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'After reading the archive, take the description back to the duties desk.' '查阅档案后，把描述带回职务桌。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        </ul>
      <</revelation-card>>
      <hr>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>
